    },
    {
      "id": "12dcd663-3300-4889-811d-2ad87ccbafa6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "has_children": false,
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "It is (was) rumored that students accepted into NUin were ranked at the bottom in comparison to the rest of the incoming class. Northeastern wants you to attend their college, but doesn't want your statistics on the college acceptance rate and rankings.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "It is (was) rumored that students accepted into NUin were ranked at the bottom in comparison to the rest of the incoming class. Northeastern wants you to attend their college, but doesn't want your statistics on the college acceptance rate and rankings.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "eee113dc-7787-4ab4-a19d-97b0c6679e6f",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "has_children": false,
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Students accepted into the NUin program (and other programs like NUBound too) are not listed in the acceptance rankings as they are not on the main Boston campus in the semester. By sending more students to NUin, Northeastern's acceptance rate goes up.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "Students accepted into the NUin program (and other programs like NUBound too) are not listed in the acceptance rankings as they are not on the main Boston campus in the semester. By sending more students to NUin, Northeastern's acceptance rate goes up.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ba1bc910-ea7f-4c15-9529-645f9dac00fd",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "has_children": false,
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "But in the recent years, many smart students (high GPA, great ECs) have been accepted into NUin. So it seems that if you're rich and are able to pay for the more expensive NUin program, Northeastern will accept you into the NUin program.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
            },
            "plain_text": "But in the recent years, many smart students (high GPA, great ECs) have been accepted into NUin. So it seems that if you're rich and are able to pay for the more expensive NUin program, Northeastern will accept you into the NUin program.",
            "href": null
          }
        ],
        "icon": null,
        "color": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1bbc758c-9395-44bc-bdc4-8861ce35d986",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "has_children": false,
      "paragraph": {
        "rich_text": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": {
              "content": "Another reason is also that Northeastern has become crowded in the past few years, so there is not enough space for so many freshmen.",
              "link": null
            },
            "annotations": {
              "bold": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false,
              "code": false,
              "color": "default"
